    "blurb": "Flexible end-user app for Camunda",
    "overview": "A highly adaptable business platform, Cabinee combines a ready-to-use end-user application with native Camunda integration to automate virtually any process in days, not months.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Fast-track your end-to-end process automation in days",
    "splashDescription": "Teams juggling customer requests, internal operations, CRM processes and approvals across scattered tools lose time, context and visibility into what's actually happening. Cabinee turns your process into the interface: it brings all of these process types into one unified workspace, built as a ready-to-use end-user application with native Camunda integration. Because it ships ready to use and adapts to your process without custom development, your team can learn it in minutes and go from process design to a live, automated process in days rather than months.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/862177/overview/img5629486936670012700.png?f78c4459908f4a1e460db9c8e2144894",
